    //- Start Decoration
    .decore#decoration
        .container

            .main-heading
                .container
                    .text
                        h2 Decoration

            .decore-content

                .decore-text
                    p
                        | Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Id consequatur quibusdam laborum perferendis commodi aut, vitae deserunt dolorem, saepe ipsam minima tempore dolore tempora in laboriosam, hic voluptates obcaecati excepturi?

